 "cues": [
  {
   "id": "1.town",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.5,
   "text": "In this town, I was the only one who was not a monster."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.friend",
   "start": 2.5,
   "end": 5.2667,
   "text": "My only human friend stayed behind, to face a whole army."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.found",
   "start": 5.2667,
   "end": 7.5333,
   "text": "And all I found of him was a sword, and a helmet."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.pick",
   "start": 7.5333,
   "end": 9.8667,
   "text": "I picked the helmet up. I did not see what was behind me."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.tree",
   "start": 9.8667,
   "end": 12.9667,
   "text": "Behind a tree was my dad's arm. I had dropped it. It had followed me."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.watch",
   "start": 12.9667,
   "end": 15.0333,
   "text": "It was watching me. Do not ask me how."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.crawl",
   "start": 15.0333,
   "end": 17.2,
   "text": "It started to crawl over to me, on its fingers."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.hide",
   "start": 17.2,
   "end": 19.3333,
   "text": "Then it stopped, and went back behind the tree."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.player",
   "start": 19.3333,
   "end": 21.7,
   "text": "Somebody had seen me. A player, coming down the street."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.more",
   "start": 21.7,
   "end": 23.0,
   "text": "Then two. Then ten."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.grab",
   "start": 23.0,
   "end": 24.9333,
   "text": "They grabbed me, and put a sack over my head."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.help",
   "start": 24.9333,
   "end": 27.3667,
   "text": "The arm ran out to help. It got one player by the ankle."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.many",
   "start": 27.3667,
   "end": 28.9,
   "text": "There were too many. It let go."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.later",
   "start": 28.9,
   "end": 31.0333,
   "text": "What happened next, I only heard about later."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.crawl",
   "start": 31.0333,
   "end": 33.5,
   "text": "The arm crawled all the way back to the pig farm."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.four",
   "start": 33.5,
   "end": 36.3,
   "text": "It took four minutes. It is a fast arm."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.mud",
   "start": 36.3,
   "end": 39.3333,
   "text": "It went down through the mud, and across the floor, to my dad."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.dad",
   "start": 39.3333,
   "end": 42.4667,
   "text": "\"My arm!\" said my dad. He was so happy. He took it back."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.look",
   "start": 42.4667,
   "end": 45.4,
   "text": "Then he looked at it. And his face fell off. Then he put his face back."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.shout",
   "start": 45.4,
   "end": 47.3333,
   "text": "\"My son got taken away by the players?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "4.nobody",
   "start": 47.3333,
   "end": 50.2,
   "text": "Nobody looked worried. I am still a bit hurt about that."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.moved",
   "start": 50.2,
   "end": 53.4667,
   "text": "Then the arm moved again. A finger went up. A finger went down."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.villagers",
   "start": 53.4667,
   "end": 55.1,
   "text": "\"He went to the villagers?\" said my dad."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.scared",
   "start": 55.1,
   "end": 56.6333,
   "text": "Now everybody was scared."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.hiss",
   "start": 56.6333,
   "end": 58.2667,
   "text": "\"There is a thing in that village,\" said Hiss."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.golem",
   "start": 58.2667,
   "end": 61.4667,
   "text": "\"An iron golem. It can wipe out a lot of monsters. With one arm.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "5.down",
   "start": 61.4667,
   "end": 64.0333,
   "text": "They all looked down at the floor. They thought about it for a long time."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.again",
   "start": 64.0333,
   "end": 66.7,
   "text": "My dad was the first one to talk. He talked to his arm."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.east",
   "start": 66.7,
   "end": 68.5,
   "text": "\"It says he is in the east,\" he said."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.plug",
   "start": 68.5,
   "end": 70.4667,
   "text": "Then he plugged the arm back in. Click."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.teacher",
   "start": 70.4667,
   "end": 72.7333,
   "text": "The enderman teacher was still thinking about the golem."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.how",
   "start": 72.7333,
   "end": 76.2333,
   "text": "\"Wait,\" he said, to nobody. \"Am I actually believing an arm?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "6.shrug",
   "start": 76.2333,
   "end": 76.8333,
   "text": "He was."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.mum",
   "start": 76.8333,
   "end": 78.2,
   "text": "Then my mum put her hand up."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.plan",
   "start": 78.2,
   "end": 83.1333,
   "text": "\"I have a plan,\" she said. And they all moved in closer."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.dark",
   "start": 83.1333,
   "end": 84.7,
   "text": "It was dark for a long time."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.blink",
   "start": 84.7,
   "end": 86.8,
   "text": "Then I opened my eyes. It was day."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.bars",
   "start": 86.8,
   "end": 89.8,
   "text": "I was behind bars. A cage, in the middle of a village."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.village",
   "start": 89.8,
   "end": 93.0,
   "text": "It was not a normal village. There was a castle wall all the way around it."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.guards",
   "start": 93.0,
   "end": 95.1667,
   "text": "There were villager guards with swords at every door."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.towers",
   "start": 95.1667,
   "end": 97.3333,
   "text": "And players up on the towers, looking down."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.cages",
   "start": 97.3333,
   "end": 100.2667,
   "text": "There were more cages next to mine. Empty. Empty. Empty."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.mo",
   "start": 100.2667,
   "end": 102.4667,
   "text": "And one that was not. Mo! He was not moving."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.reach",
   "start": 102.4667,
   "end": 105.0333,
   "text": "I put my arm through the bars to reach him. He was much too far."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.dumb",
   "start": 105.0333,
   "end": 106.0,
   "text": "It was a dumb idea."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.saw",
   "start": 106.0,
   "end": 107.5333,
   "text": "A guard had seen that I was awake."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.laugh",
   "start": 107.5333,
   "end": 109.1,
   "text": "He looked at me. And he laughed."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.over",
   "start": 109.1,
   "end": 111.8667,
   "text": "I looked down at my feet. I thought it was over."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.other",
   "start": 111.8667,
   "end": 114.2,
   "text": "But on the other side of the forest, there was a mansion."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.pillagers",
   "start": 114.2,
   "end": 117.6333,
   "text": "In it lived the pillagers. And nobody hates players more than a pillager."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.knock",
   "start": 117.6333,
   "end": 120.1667,
   "text": "That night, somebody knocked on their door. It was my mum."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.map",
   "start": 120.1667,
   "end": 123.3,
   "text": "She put a map on their table. \"They have my son,\" she said."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.chief",
   "start": 123.3,
   "end": 126.4667,
   "text": "The chief looked at forty monsters in his hall. \"And what do we get?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "10.castle",
   "start": 126.4667,
   "end": 128.0,
   "text": "\"The castle,\" said my mum."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.shake",
   "start": 128.0,
   "end": 130.2667,
   "text": "He shook my dad's hand. The arm came off again."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.deal",
   "start": 130.2667,
   "end": 131.3333,
   "text": "\"Deal,\" said the chief."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.cabinet",
   "start": 131.3333,
   "end": 133.2,
   "text": "Then he opened a cabinet as big as a wall."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.swords",
   "start": 133.2,
   "end": 134.6333,
   "text": "The pillagers took out their swords."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.bows",
   "start": 134.6333,
   "end": 138.0,
   "text": "They took out their crossbows, and loaded them. Click. Click. Click."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.axes",
   "start": 138.0,
   "end": 141.6,
   "text": "They took out axes, and shields, and one very big banner."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.ready",
   "start": 141.6,
   "end": 143.4667,
   "text": "In one minute, the whole mansion was ready."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.cheer",
   "start": 143.4667,
   "end": 147.2667,
   "text": "And forty monsters cheered! They jumped up and down. A creeper nearly went off."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.two",
   "start": 147.2667,
   "end": 149.4,
   "text": "At the back, two pillagers looked at each other."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.why",
   "start": 149.4,
   "end": 152.0667,
   "text": "\"Why are they cheering?\" said one. \"We only said yes.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "10.dunno",
   "start": 152.0667,
   "end": 154.4333,
   "text": "The other one did not know either."
  },
  {
   "id": "11.sub",
   "start": 154.4333,
   "end": 156.2,
   "text": "Like and subscribe for part four."
  }
 ],
